"""Phase 10 diagnostics — original CIA items only (no EFQM Model text, no assessor-training or award material). Every item
allows "I don't know" through its assessment.

READINESS — excellence readiness diagnostic (ASM-READY-EX-001): 12 items across excellence logic, evidence, RADAR, strengths and
            areas for improvement, prioritisation, leadership and performance measurement.
ROUTE     — extra items per route diagnostic; the builder adds the route courses' first lesson checks.
The Phase 5 demo item Q-EFQM-001 keeps its id and subjective type (evidence review); its topic is re-expressed as the
auto-scored twin Q-EX-RD-03. Author: مدثر سلامه."""
from lib10 import T, opt, question  # noqa: F401

D = "diagnostic"


def q(qid, comp, prompt, options, correct, expl, **kw):
    kw.setdefault("fmt", D)
    return question(qid, comp, prompt, options, correct, expl, **kw)


